# ld64 -exported_symbols_list for libmpi_abi -- the macOS half of NOTES.md
# #9's "a version script on ELF and -exported_symbols_list on macOS"; see
# cmake/mpi_abi.version for the ELF side and why this restricts rather than
# merely documents the export set. Mach-O C symbols carry a leading
# underscore that the ABI header's own names do not.
#
# The MPIX_/PMPIX_ pair is not covered by the two above -- `_MPI_*` needs `_`
# as its fifth character -- and without them the non-standard entry points
# (NOTES.md #7 decision 28) are simply not exported.
_MPI_*
_PMPI_*
_MPIX_*
_PMPIX_*
